          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Received Aaron's priestly garments on Mount Hor",
      "description": "When Aaron died on Mount Hor, Moses brought Eleazar up the mountain, and Aaron's priestly garments were taken from him and placed on Eleazar as a sign that he was taking over as high priest.",
      "verses": [
        {
          "bookId": 4,
          "chapter": 20,
          "verses": [
            25,
            26,
            27,
            28
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Distribution of the Land of Canaan",
      "description": "Together with Joshua, Eleazar led the distribution of the promised land by casting lots among the tribes of Israel, in accordance with the Lord's command.",
